flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Input[/Capture NFC Tag UID and Timestamp/]
    Input --> Query[Query Database for User Profile]
    Query --> Found{User Valid?}
    
    Found -- No --> Error[/Reject Access / Log Failure/] --> End([End])
    Found -- Yes --> Status{Check Current Status}
    
    Status -- ON Campus --> Exit[Record Time-Out & Set OFF Campus] --> Save[(Save to Database)]
    Status -- OFF Campus --> TimeCheck{Exceeds Late Threshold?}
    
    TimeCheck -- Yes --> Late[/Mark as Late/]
    TimeCheck -- No --> OnTime[/Mark as On Time/]
    
    Late --> Entry[Record Time-In & Set ON Campus]
    OnTime --> Entry
    
    Entry --> Save
    Save --> Success([Grant Access]) --> End